{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_012F2u74SjpcXBjM5Ki6gzZq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QyRh3ZhypMokmMn2Rk1XQU","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/yosefgamble/github/Aurialis/ralph/fix_plan.md","old_string":"- [ ] **Stereo sub-split DSP (`stereo-split.ts`) is never wired into the mixer.**\n  Add a \"Split L/R\" control gated on `hasPannedContent`. Done when: control splits\n  a panned stem + test.","new_string":"- [x] **Stereo sub-split DSP (`stereo-split.ts`) is never wired into the mixer.**\n  Wired a client-side \"Split L/R\" control into StemsView: a per-stem effect runs\n  `analyzePanContent` off-render to gate the button on `hasPannedContent`;\n  `handleSplitStereo` M/S-decodes the stem and replaces it with two hard-panned\n  L/R sub-stems. Track-building extracted to the pure `buildStereoSubTracks`\n  helper (`src/lib/mix/split-stereo-tracks.ts`) + unit test."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":108293,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"243c3f7c-ee0e-426f-a231-33e2ba1d8e5c","uuid":"56294408-3279-4c67-983c-d0624203e036","request_id":"req_011CcahU4jEU8apkzmcCm7H3"}
